WEBVTT

vo-01
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.333
Humanity learned to build intelligence.

vo-02
00:00:03.533 --> 00:00:07.933
But what happens when the world needs more computing power than it can afford?

vo-03
00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:13.867
Across the world, computing power sits unused, while innovators struggle to reach it.

vo-04
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:17.767
What if these scattered resources could work together?

vo-05
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:25.933
io.net brings distributed GPU resources together through a decentralized computing network.

vo-06
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:30.667
The next breakthrough might begin with connecting what already exists.

vo-07
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:36.467
The world doesn't just need more intelligence.

vo-08
00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:39.333
It needs more ways to power it.
